 "story": "Liverpool beat Villarreal 4-3 at Anfield in the Champions League. Georges Mikautadze and Sergi Cardona gave Villarreal a 2-0 lead, but Alexis Mac Allister levelled in the 36th minute and Ronald Araujo struck in the second minute of stoppage time before half-time. Mac Allister scored again in the 65th minute, Florian Wirtz made it 4-2 in the 68th, and Tani Oluwaseyi pulled one back for Villarreal in the 87th. The win lifted Liverpool to second place in the Champions League table on nine points from three games.",
